# ── Large artifacts: NEVER in git ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every project's `checkpoints` is a symlink into a multi-hundred-GB store (674 GB for
# tofu_sisa_lora alone). Recreate them per SETUP.md; see PORTING.md for TOFU_CKPT_ROOT.
checkpoints
*/checkpoints
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.ckpt

# ── Upstream clones (fetch_upstream.sh recreates these at pinned commits) ─────────────────────
/S3T/
/MemSinks/
/open-unlearning/

# ── Python / tooling noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
.venv/

# ── Run-time chatter ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SLURM logs land beside results on the cluster; they are not results.
*.out
*.err
logs_*/
# Per-eval checkpointing files, not results (snapshot_results.py excludes them too).
*.progress.json

# ── The manuscript — NEVER committed ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# paper/pdf/ and paper/tex/ hold an anonymized submission under review whose own notice reads
# "Distribution, citation, or public sharing of this manuscript is strictly prohibited", and this
# repo is public. paper/README.md (the claim -> code map) stays; it cites results, not prose.
# Originals live in the working tree, not here.
paper/pdf/
paper/tex/
*p_unlearn*
